==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.29.0|
* Copying an item's text now always copies the advanced description format.
* Searching by an item's text will now match the advanced description format.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* The range you can pick up items when using a keyboard and mouse has been increased, to be more on par with Controller Input mode.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.8.6|
* Added heaps of new item tiers to each progression, so that they are spaced out better at higher difficulties, and scale properly to the new maximum item levels. The highest tier are extremely rare.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.8.1|
* Changed how rare item names are generated.
* Dropped item base type selection is now biased towards items at 70% of your character's level.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.8.0|
* Condensed requirements on items to be more concise.
* Reduced drop rate of rares and uniques by 25%.
* Rares are now biased towards spawning with four mods.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.7.2|
* [[Rare]]s can now have six mods.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.7.1|
* Fixed a bug that would cause items to get deleted.
* Fixed exploits with creating and using empty stack items.
* Fixed an item duplication exploit.
* Slightly reduced drop rate of [[magic]]s, increased rate of [[rare]]s, reduced rate of [[unique]]s.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.7.0|
* Ground items now show socket arrangement.
